cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this paper or its Lean formalization, please cite this work."
title: "The Riemann Hypothesis and the Reality of Almost All Jensen Polynomial Zeros"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ono"
    given-names: "Ken"
    email: "ken@axiommath.ai"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of the theorem that, for every number field K, all but
  O_K(sqrt(d log d)) zeros of its degree-d unshifted Dedekind Jensen polynomial
  are distinct negative real zeros, together with the Riemann-xi specialization
  and an expanded manuscript.
keywords:
  - "Dedekind zeta function"
  - "Riemann zeta function"
  - "Jensen polynomial"
  - "Lean 4"
  - "formalized mathematics"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AxiomMath/riemann-jensen-polynomials"
url: "https://github.com/AxiomMath/riemann-jensen-polynomials"
license: "Apache-2.0"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-21"
